  "result": "I fixed both bugs in `src/cart.js`, and `npm test` now passes all 243 tests. I didn't touch the tests.\n\n1. **Steps in the wrong order:** `total()` added tax first and took the discount off afterwards. The comment in the code says the discount comes off the pre-tax subtotal, so I swapped the two steps. With a fixed discount this made a real difference, which is why the test expected 88 and got 90.\n2. **Total could go negative:** a fixed discount bigger than the subtotal gave -14.5 instead of 0. I now cap the discounted amount at zero before adding tax.\n\nPercentage discounts were passing before because the order doesn't change the result for them.",
